st - simple terminal
--------------------
st is a simple terminal emulator for Wayland.


Requirements
------------
Build dependencies: wayland-client, wayland-cursor, wayland-protocols,
wayland-scanner, xkbcommon, Fontconfig, FreeType, pixman and fcft.
With LIGATURES_PATCH enabled, fcft must provide text-run shaping support.
Cairo and X11/Xft development packages are not required.


Installation
------------
Edit config.mk to match your local setup (st is installed into
the /usr/local namespace by default).

Afterwards enter the following command to build and install st (if
necessary as root):

    make clean install


Running st
----------
If you did not install st with make clean install, you must compile
the st terminfo entry with the following command:

    tic -sx st.info

See the man page for additional details.

